Hello <%= @tenant.first_name %>,

<% if @grants.one? %>
Your access has been set up for the following storage unit.

  Facility:     <%= @business.name %>
  Location:     <%= @grants.first.lock.location.name %>
  Unit:         Unit <%= @grants.first.lock.unit_identifier %>
  Access from:  <%= @grants.first.starts_at.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %>
  Access until: <%= @grants.first.ends_at.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %>

YOUR PIN
--------
<%= @grants.first.pin_ciphertext %>

<% elsif @same_pin %>
Your access has been set up for <%= @grants.count %> storage units. Your PIN works on all of them.

YOUR PIN
--------
<%= @grants.first.pin_ciphertext %>

UNITS
-----
<% @grants.each do |grant| %>
  Unit <%= grant.lock.unit_identifier %> — <%= grant.lock.location.name %>
  Access: <%= grant.starts_at.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %> to <%= grant.ends_at.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %>

<% end %>
<% else %>
Your access has been set up for <%= @grants.count %> storage units, each with its own PIN.

<% @grants.each do |grant| %>
Unit <%= grant.lock.unit_identifier %> — <%= grant.lock.location.name %>
Access: <%= grant.starts_at.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %> to <%= grant.ends_at.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %>
PIN: <%= grant.pin_ciphertext %>

<% end %>
<% end %>
HOW TO ACCESS YOUR UNIT
------------------------
Enter your PIN on the keypad beside the door. When accepted, slide the bolt to open. To lock up, slide the bolt back to the closed position.

---
This email was sent by Northbolt on behalf of <%= @business.name %>.
Please do not reply to this email.
